flowchart TD
    C[Approved campaign] --> A[Audit verified capabilities]
    A --> H[Generate and register hypotheses]
    H --> B[Bounded Send preparation batches]
    B --> S[Specification critique and review subgraphs]
    S --> E[One durable experiment thread]
    E --> Q[Qualification and compilation]
    Q --> V[Baseline and implementation verification]
    V --> J[Register budget and outbox]
    J --> I[Interrupt for external job]
    I --> R[Verified ingestion and robustness]
    R --> X[Independent reconstruction]
    X --> F[Deterministic grade and memory]
    F --> Y[Registry-based campaign synthesis]
    Y --> P{Eligible frozen finalist batch?}
    P -->|No| T[Exploratory terminal evidence]
    P -->|Yes| U[Protected confirmation subgraph]
    U --> K[Authorization interrupt]
    K --> L[Sealed evaluation and Holm correction]
    L --> Z[Signed result and superseding finding]
    Q -->|Missing data| F
    V -->|Implementation failure| F
